  "body": "Decision record for #5869: backup, recovery & exit for serverless storage.\n\nSettles, at the #5863 storage-contract level (so it does not guess or constrain the #5867/#5681 backend choice):\n- PITR as signed-journal replay: entry granularity, 30-day journal / 90-day daily / 1-year weekly retention, and the four contract hooks each backend must expose; provider-native PITR is an accelerator only.\n- Backup = the open-format export bundle (manifest + canonical journal + contract-form snapshot + content-addressed blobs), with a no-lossy-types completeness guarantee and explicit exclusions.\n- Provider-exit runbook: freeze at a named sequence → export → restore into an independent target → replay-equivalence verification → cutover → teardown as the explicit point of no return.\n- Restore verification and drill cadence (monthly restore drill, quarterly exit rehearsal, drill-on-change), and invariants E1–E7 for implementation.\n\nBoundary stated in the record: #5867 owns backend choice/migration, #5863 owns the contract, #5868 prices the retention windows; no parent (#5681) decision is changed.\n\nCloses #5869\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796753209&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7774&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7774&signature=036f5c4d00c4a25097c2d3c49247b47db0e83d7b75d38b8bf86e435516c606a0\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.